# ==============================================================================
# ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES TEMPLATE (RAHUL & JYOTI STUDIO)
# Copy this file to '.env' and fill in your actual private credentials locally.
# IMPORTANT: '.env' is strictly gitignored and will NEVER be pushed to GitHub!
